1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,550
This is MezoRemit.

2
00:00:01,812 --> 00:00:05,712
It sends money across borders and settles in MUSD,

3
00:00:05,875 --> 00:00:07,938
the Bitcoin-backed dollar on Mezo.

4
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:11,225
Sending money home is still slow and expensive,

5
00:00:11,388 --> 00:00:13,775
and the fees are hard to see until it's too late.

6
00:00:14,427 --> 00:00:17,202
MezoRemit shows every cost before you send.

7
00:00:17,464 --> 00:00:18,977
You can pay straight to a wallet,

8
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:21,132
or send a claim link to someone who doesn't have

9
00:00:21,152 --> 00:00:22,027
a wallet yet.

10
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,927
Recipients can be in Mexico,

11
00:00:24,014 --> 00:00:25,602
the Philippines, India,

12
00:00:25,864 --> 00:00:26,914
Europe and more.

13
00:00:27,177 --> 00:00:29,677
Every currency is shown with its own symbol.

14
00:00:30,328 --> 00:00:32,840
Let's send money live on Mezo Testnet.

15
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:35,340
The sender connects with Mezo Passport,

16
00:00:35,553 --> 00:00:37,516
so Bitcoin wallets like Unisat,

17
00:00:37,741 --> 00:00:41,265
OKX and Xverse work, as well as any Ethereum wallet.

18
00:00:41,540 --> 00:00:43,466
Signing in is a free signature,

19
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,753
not a transaction.

20
00:00:46,627 --> 00:00:48,302
First, where the money is going.

21
00:00:48,564 --> 00:00:49,902
We'll send to the Philippines,

22
00:00:49,939 --> 00:00:51,302
in Philippine pesos.

23
00:00:51,952 --> 00:00:53,527
Twenty-five MUSD.

24
00:00:53,802 --> 00:00:55,364
The wallet balance is right there,

25
00:00:55,577 --> 00:00:56,915
so there are no surprises.

26
00:00:57,578 --> 00:01:00,102
The sender doesn't know their cousin's wallet address.

27
00:01:00,378 --> 00:01:01,078
That's fine.

28
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:03,715
MezoRemit makes a claim link instead.

29
00:01:04,378 --> 00:01:06,378
The link expires in seven days.

30
00:01:06,641 --> 00:01:08,191
If nobody claims it by then,

31
00:01:08,404 --> 00:01:10,066
the money goes back to the sender.

32
00:01:10,729 --> 00:01:14,542
Before anything moves, the review screen lists every line.

33
00:01:14,817 --> 00:01:17,330
The service fee is zero on testnet.

34
00:01:17,604 --> 00:01:20,092
The network fee is paid in BTC.

35
00:01:20,380 --> 00:01:22,080
The peso rate is shown too,

36
00:01:22,192 --> 00:01:23,880
clearly marked as an estimate,

37
00:01:23,992 --> 00:01:26,204
because the recipient gets MUSD.

38
00:01:26,479 --> 00:01:28,167
The sender adds a short message.

39
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:31,848
One signature and one transaction lock the twenty-five

40
00:01:31,868 --> 00:01:34,268
MUSD in the contract on Mezo.

41
00:01:34,530 --> 00:01:36,130
MezoRemit never holds it.

42
00:01:41,093 --> 00:01:41,956
The link is ready.

43
00:01:42,230 --> 00:01:44,773
The secret key lives only in the part of the link

44
00:01:44,793 --> 00:01:47,043
that browsers never send to a server,

45
00:01:47,193 --> 00:01:49,280
so even MezoRemit can't claim it.

46
00:01:49,556 --> 00:01:51,868
The sender shares it in any private chat,

47
00:01:52,105 --> 00:01:53,368
or as a QR code.

48
00:01:54,020 --> 00:01:55,946
Now the recipient opens the link.

49
00:01:56,220 --> 00:01:58,058
They see the amount, who sent it,

50
00:01:58,208 --> 00:01:59,083
and the message.

51
00:01:59,747 --> 00:02:00,759
They connect a wallet.

52
00:02:01,022 --> 00:02:03,784
No account to create, and no BTC needed.

53
00:02:04,435 --> 00:02:05,423
Claiming is free.

54
00:02:05,685 --> 00:02:08,435
MezoRemit's relayer pays the network fee,

55
00:02:08,598 --> 00:02:11,723
and the contract only pays the wallet named in the claim.

56
00:02:11,985 --> 00:02:13,360
Nobody can redirect it.

57
00:02:14,855 --> 00:02:15,255
Done.

58
00:02:15,518 --> 00:02:19,143
Twenty-five MUSD landed in the recipient's own wallet,

59
00:02:19,306 --> 00:02:22,380
with a link to the transaction on the Mezo explorer.

60
00:02:23,044 --> 00:02:24,419
Back on the sender's side,

61
00:02:24,556 --> 00:02:26,269
the transfer shows as claimed.

62
00:02:26,531 --> 00:02:28,824
Each step was checked against Mezo before it was

63
00:02:28,844 --> 00:02:29,794
marked as done.

64
00:02:30,445 --> 00:02:33,033
No pooled funds, no admin keys,

65
00:02:33,095 --> 00:02:34,770
and every fee shown up front.

66
00:02:35,045 --> 00:02:37,495
The testnet contracts are listed in the footer.

67
00:02:37,770 --> 00:02:40,758
That's MezoRemit: send money across borders,

68
00:02:40,833 --> 00:02:42,420
settle in MUSD.

